WEBVTT

00:01:29.812 --> 00:01:33.760
Our highest offices
are plagued by corruption.

00:01:33.784 --> 00:01:38.122
We're on the brink
of a sort of apathetic apocalypse,

00:01:38.146 --> 00:01:40.939
and it's not OK.

00:01:40.963 --> 00:01:42.598
We've got to open the doors

00:01:42.622 --> 00:01:44.014
to city halls and schools

00:01:44.038 --> 00:01:47.800
so wide that people
can't help but walk in.

00:01:48.158 --> 00:01:51.245
We've got to throw out
the old top-down processes

00:01:51.269 --> 00:01:53.150
that got us into this mess,

00:01:53.174 --> 00:01:54.682
and start over,

00:01:54.706 --> 00:01:57.060
with new faces around the table,

00:01:57.084 --> 00:01:59.115
new voices in the mix,

00:01:59.139 --> 00:02:03.607
and we have to welcome new perspectives
every step of the way.